{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And YHWH went, etc.</b> Once the defender fell silent, the judge departed." "<b>And Abraham returned to his place.</b> The judge withdrew, the defender withdrew, and the prosecutor goes on prosecuting — therefore, ״וַיָּבֹאוּ שְׁנֵי הַמַּלְאָכִים סְדֹמָה לְהַשְׁחִית״ — the two angels came to Sodom to destroy it."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:23.252807596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}